# Review A3: a picture that runs over its frame by less than a frame must not
# start the next one while the copper still shows the list (and the frame
# buffer) that one writes: COP1LC only takes the new list at the next vertical
# blank, so the next picture waits for the first blank after its swap.
# Ctrl+L, O (a test key): the next 8 pictures each run to line 60 of the frame after.
start-at boarding
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x18
wait 30
expect-serial "AGK overrun"
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR"
